{"text": "grammatical", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From Middle French <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"frm\">grammatical</i>, from Latin <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">grammatic\u0101lis</i>.\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Adjective", "definitions": [{"definition": " Not breaching any constraints of the grammar, or morpho-syntax, of the relevant language.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {"Synonym": ["grammatic"], "Antonyms": ["ungrammatical", "agrammatical", "ungrammatic"], "Coordinate term": ["idiomatic"]}}, {"definition": " Of or pertaining to grammar.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {"Synonym": ["grammatic"]}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["IPA", "/\u0261\u0279\u0259\u02c8m\u00e6t\u026ak\u0259l/"]]}